  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo al Programa de Reformas del Sector Trasporte y Logstica de Panam</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support For Panama&apos;s Transport and Logistics Sector Reform Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Los objetivos especficos del programa son: (i) fortalecimiento del marco legal y regulatorio;(ii) consolidacin del marco institucional de logstica y transporte; y (iii) fortalecimiento del sistema de planificacin multisectorial y de facilitacin commercial.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programs specific objectives are to: (i) strengthen the legal and regulatory framework; (ii) consolidate the institutional framework for the transport and logistics sector; and (iii) strengthen the multisector planning and trade facilitation system.</narrative>
  </description>
